WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:02.020
Subtitle source: "Kid the Phantom Thief (Magic Kaito) - 01 [DCTP][720p][700395F0].mp4"

00:40.430 --> 00:42.520
It's already been eight years!

00:40.640 --> 00:43.810
Nakamori Ginzou

00:42.520 --> 00:43.810
I'm placing you under arrest this time!

00:50.820 --> 00:51.860
Damn!

00:52.940 --> 00:53.740
Don't just stand there!

00:53.740 --> 00:54.860
After him! After him!

00:58.320 --> 00:59.740
Team Alpha!

00:59.740 --> 01:01.280
Get to Area B3 on the 5th floor!

01:01.620 --> 01:03.660
Team Beta, head to Area C6!

01:08.420 --> 01:09.380
He's gone!

01:09.380 --> 01:10.540
That can't be!

01:14.050 --> 01:15.170
What's this about?

01:21.140 --> 01:22.310
There you are, Kid!

01:49.040 --> 01:52.000
Kid, how many years have I yearned for—

01:52.000 --> 01:53.420
No, I mean...

01:53.420 --> 01:55.300
How long have I chased you around?

01:55.760 --> 01:58.170
I, Nakamori Ginzou, would never fall for such a simple trap!

02:04.760 --> 02:05.770
Your body disappeared!

02:13.400 --> 02:16.480
Kaitou Kid Reappears!!

02:16.480 --> 02:17.860
8 Years Since Last Crime

02:17.860 --> 02:18.780
Kid returns after 8 years!

02:18.780 --> 02:19.860
Stolen diamond valued at 300 million yen

02:19.860 --> 02:21.740
300 Million Yen
Diamond Stolen!!

02:20.740 --> 02:21.740
Hey, hey, did you see?

02:22.030 --> 02:23.200
Kaitou Kid!

02:23.200 --> 02:24.530
He's the coolest!

02:24.870 --> 02:25.740
Yo, Kaito.

02:26.660 --> 02:27.540
Kuroba-kun!

02:27.540 --> 02:28.450
Good morning, Kaito-kun.

02:28.790 --> 02:30.540
Say, did you see the news?

02:30.540 --> 02:32.000
About Kaitou Kid?

02:32.000 --> 02:32.920
He's so amazing!

02:33.500 --> 02:34.040
Huh?

02:34.040 --> 02:34.630
Kaito...

02:35.380 --> 02:38.340
Nakamori Aoko

02:35.800 --> 02:37.130
What are you...

02:37.130 --> 02:38.340
Quit staring at me like that...

02:38.720 --> 02:40.720
Kuroba Kaito

02:38.760 --> 02:40.170
Good morning, Aoko.

02:41.840 --> 02:42.260
Good morning...

02:44.470 --> 02:45.180
Kaito?

02:45.560 --> 02:47.600
What is...

02:47.930 --> 02:50.520
Today's...

02:49.890 --> 02:50.520
His neck—

02:50.810 --> 02:51.730
Color?

02:54.480 --> 02:56.070
It's white!

02:56.070 --> 02:57.820
White is nice, very pure!

03:00.320 --> 03:01.700
Kaito!

03:02.160 --> 03:03.620
Why you...

03:02.160 --> 03:03.620
anata

03:03.620 --> 03:04.910
Hold it.

03:04.910 --> 03:07.240
Don't just call me "dear".

03:04.910 --> 03:07.240
anata

03:07.870 --> 03:10.500
That's how one addresses their lover, you know.

03:11.960 --> 03:13.420
Lover!?

03:13.420 --> 03:14.580
Like hell we are!

03:15.540 --> 03:16.540
Aoko!

03:16.540 --> 03:18.590
And don't just call me Aoko!

03:18.590 --> 03:20.380
I'm not your girlfriend!

03:20.920 --> 03:22.880
Class has already started, you know...

03:23.340 --> 03:24.430
Kuroba Kaito!

03:24.430 --> 03:25.600
Simplify this expression!

03:26.930 --> 03:28.180
2xy...

03:28.180 --> 03:29.140
To the power of 2!

03:29.600 --> 03:30.390
Correct...

03:30.600 --> 03:32.850
They're just panties!

03:32.850 --> 03:33.810
What!?

03:34.020 --> 03:35.810
Then, how about this question!?

03:35.810 --> 03:36.480
Nakamori Aoko!

03:36.770 --> 03:38.360
Root of 3x over 2!

03:38.730 --> 03:39.730
Correct...

03:39.730 --> 03:41.030
What do you mean they're just panties!?

03:41.280 --> 03:44.410
It's your fault for falling for my magic in the first place!

03:44.780 --> 03:47.740
'Course, nobody can top my magic!

03:48.280 --> 03:49.740
Don't think you're so great, Kaito!

03:49.740 --> 03:51.370
You still can't beat Kaitou Kid!

03:52.040 --> 03:53.580
Kaitou Kid?

03:53.580 --> 03:55.290
That thief who uses magic!

03:55.290 --> 03:56.500
Haven't you heard?

04:02.050 --> 04:04.050
Finally come down, Kaito?

04:04.050 --> 04:05.300
N-No!

04:05.300 --> 04:07.100
I-I'm not Kaito!

04:07.100 --> 04:07.890
What?

04:07.890 --> 04:09.680
Think you can use those glasses as a disguise?

04:09.970 --> 04:11.220
Interesting!

04:11.220 --> 04:12.980
I'm gonna get that thief, then.

04:15.230 --> 04:15.810
Huh?

04:16.270 --> 04:18.110
I'll go catch him!

04:18.110 --> 04:19.520
No, I'm going to catch <i>you</i>!

04:20.530 --> 04:22.320
Wrong, I'm not Kaito.

04:22.650 --> 04:24.700
Fine, fine, who are you now?

04:24.700 --> 04:25.740
Actually...

04:25.740 --> 04:26.610
I'm...

04:26.610 --> 04:28.280
A Martian!

04:34.210 --> 04:34.910
No way...

04:35.420 --> 04:36.170
Seeya!

04:37.540 --> 04:38.880
Kaito is a Martian!?

04:39.090 --> 04:41.550
Like hell you are!

04:42.380 --> 04:43.590
Stupid Aoko!

04:43.590 --> 04:44.760
Stop it!

04:48.720 --> 04:49.350
What is this!?

04:49.720 --> 04:50.680
Not good...

05:01.070 --> 05:04.570
KAAAIIIITOOOOO!!!

05:12.700 --> 05:14.040
Geez...

05:14.040 --> 05:17.080
You should be thankful you weren't expelled or something...

05:17.080 --> 05:20.250
I guess I need to work on my finale...

05:20.250 --> 05:21.840
I'll try Venusian next time...

05:20.500 --> 05:22.550
Barbeque today!

05:21.840 --> 05:22.880
Jeez...

05:22.550 --> 05:24.010
Barbeque, barbeque!

05:22.880 --> 05:24.340
Why do you have to do that?

05:27.260 --> 05:28.760
Hey, hey, hey, hey...

05:28.760 --> 05:30.550
Oh, wow!

05:30.550 --> 05:32.810
You're having a barbeque with your mom and dad?

05:32.810 --> 05:34.640
You shouldn't be crying!

05:34.640 --> 05:35.270
Looky-here!

05:36.140 --> 05:36.730
There it is.

05:39.230 --> 05:42.770
Now, have a safe trip home with Moomoo-chan, all right?

05:42.770 --> 05:43.440
Yeah!

05:45.530 --> 05:46.490
I see.

05:48.200 --> 05:48.950
It's nothing.

05:49.610 --> 05:50.740
What's that all about?

05:50.740 --> 05:52.370
I said it's nothing.

05:52.370 --> 05:53.620
Hey!

05:57.460 --> 06:00.250
I'm home, welcome home!

06:06.670 --> 06:08.720
Welcome home, Kaito!

06:08.720 --> 06:10.260
How was school?

06:10.260 --> 06:13.050
And guess where mommy is?

06:13.050 --> 06:15.470
I bet it's Ginza or Shinjuku again...

06:15.930 --> 06:17.230
Las Vegas!?

06:17.890 --> 06:20.270
Real magic shows sure are different!

06:20.270 --> 06:22.810
I've already seen three magic shows today!

06:22.810 --> 06:27.650
Jeez, spending Dad's income like running water...

06:27.650 --> 06:28.570
And, guess what?

06:28.570 --> 06:33.120
I just bumped into Touichi's friend, and
she's going to accompany me for a while!

06:35.830 --> 06:37.080
You must be lonely, but...

06:37.080 --> 06:38.830
Mom wants you to hang in there!

06:38.830 --> 06:42.000
I bet you're gonna be busy these days.

06:42.460 --> 06:43.750
What do you mean by that?

06:43.750 --> 06:47.210
Oh yeah, before I took off, Aoko-chan sent me a message...

06:47.210 --> 06:48.260
Fine, fine, got it.

06:49.760 --> 06:50.340
Aoko?

06:51.300 --> 06:52.590
Don't think you're so great, Kaito!

06:52.590 --> 06:54.260
You still can't beat Kaitou Kid!

06:55.180 --> 06:57.390
Saying whatever she wants...

06:57.390 --> 06:59.390
The only magician I can't beat...

07:00.480 --> 07:02.150
Is the one in front of me.

07:11.740 --> 07:13.780
Kuroba Touichi

07:14.160 --> 07:16.200
Jii Kounosuke

07:17.370 --> 07:19.250
Look, it's my dad!

07:19.250 --> 07:21.290
Like I didn't already know that!

07:25.340 --> 07:27.840
Are you familiar with the term "poker face," Kaito?

07:28.050 --> 07:29.590
Poker face?

07:30.220 --> 07:35.640
In poker, no matter how good or how bad your
hand is, you can't show it in your expression.

07:37.180 --> 07:38.600
The same goes for magic.

07:39.100 --> 07:40.810
Sometimes, a trick may fail.

07:41.310 --> 07:43.060
Poker face...

07:43.520 --> 07:46.360
But, you mustn't bring that to the audience's attention.

07:47.770 --> 07:48.400
Call.

07:53.030 --> 07:53.820
Kaito...

07:53.820 --> 07:56.950
No matter where you are, always keep a good poker face.

07:58.740 --> 08:01.040
Sometimes, a trick may fail.

08:03.620 --> 08:04.710
Not good...

08:05.960 --> 08:07.170
But...

08:07.170 --> 08:09.880
You mustn't bring that to the audience's attention.

08:10.460 --> 08:11.670
You're right.

08:11.670 --> 08:13.930
What I need to work on isn't my finale, but instead...

08:14.680 --> 08:16.720
My poker face.

08:18.050 --> 08:19.640
Understood, Dad.

08:42.250 --> 08:43.790
A message from Kaito's mom...

08:43.790 --> 08:44.250
New E-mail 1

08:44.250 --> 08:45.710
RE: Your question

08:44.250 --> 08:45.710
Chikage-san

08:44.250 --> 08:45.710
You've asked me about
Kaito's weakness.

08:44.250 --> 08:45.710
Actually, of all things,
Kaito is most afraid of

08:47.460 --> 08:48.920
So that's it?

08:51.420 --> 08:54.420
Kaito's weakness, GET!

08:59.260 --> 09:01.350
What the hell!?

09:04.310 --> 09:06.190
It's been a while, Kaito.

09:06.980 --> 09:07.690
Dad?

09:07.980 --> 09:11.230
I'll tell y— who I reall— a—...

09:11.230 --> 09:13.110
I am Kai— Ki—.

09:15.650 --> 09:20.490
So an eight-year lock disengaged,
activating the cassette player...

09:21.200 --> 09:25.410
That means this was Kuroba Touichi's
final magic trick, from eight years ago...

09:27.460 --> 09:29.750
It's been eight years...

09:29.750 --> 09:32.500
Why a cassette tape?

09:32.500 --> 09:35.340
What a retro-loving guy he was.

09:39.390 --> 09:40.140
These are...

09:41.510 --> 09:42.680
Just like...

10:08.290 --> 10:09.120
Listen up!

10:09.790 --> 10:12.790
Kaitou Kid's trademarks are his cape and silk hat!

10:13.210 --> 10:14.960
Engrave that into your brains!

10:14.960 --> 10:15.460
Yes, sir!

10:15.840 --> 10:18.630
Eight years ago, he suddenly vanished...

10:18.630 --> 10:20.930
And yesterday, he suddenly reappeared...

10:21.850 --> 10:24.760
I may not know what he's up to, but
I'll definitely arrest him this time.

10:26.310 --> 10:27.980
I haven't been this excited in a long time!

10:28.730 --> 10:30.060
Dad, brought your clothes.

10:30.400 --> 10:31.860
Oh, thanks a lot!

10:32.440 --> 10:34.440
We'll have a toast after I haul in Kid.

10:34.440 --> 10:35.860
I'm giving it my best!

10:36.110 --> 10:37.280
Really!

10:37.280 --> 10:39.280
But, he just came back yesterday.

10:39.280 --> 10:41.200
Would he really reappear again so soon?

10:41.410 --> 10:41.990
Inspector!

10:43.530 --> 10:44.080
Look...

10:44.080 --> 10:47.950
Kaitou Kid's Crime Manifesto ! !

10:44.280 --> 10:47.950
A moment ago, Kaitou Kid's manifesto arrived in an e-mail.

10:47.950 --> 10:49.960
TOMORROW AT 23:54
I WILL TAKE THE MOON'S PUPIL
LOCATED INSIDE THE TOKYO CITY
MUSEUM!

10:48.910 --> 10:50.290
Tomorrow, at 23:54...

10:50.080 --> 10:51.040
No way...

10:52.330 --> 10:54.290
We're celebrating tomorrow!

10:55.380 --> 10:57.800
TOMORROW AT 23:54

11:24.700 --> 11:26.240
All right—cameras, switch.

11:31.620 --> 11:34.500
A landmark, grand-scale cordon
has been assembled by the police.

11:35.170 --> 11:39.090
Rumored to be dead, Kaitou Kid has
resurfaced after an eight year absence.

11:39.510 --> 11:42.180
Will he reveal himself tonight, or...

11:42.590 --> 11:44.470
Eight years, huh?

11:44.470 --> 11:47.100
When Dad died in that performance was also...

11:55.900 --> 11:57.360
Could Dad be...

11:58.940 --> 12:00.240
Maybe...

12:00.240 --> 12:01.820
I can meet this guy and learn the truth...

12:02.280 --> 12:03.740
If I can meet Kid!

12:08.950 --> 12:11.250
Kuroba Touichi's final magic trick...

12:11.870 --> 12:13.210
Will be revealed by me!

12:14.960 --> 12:15.830
Look out, Dad!

12:20.090 --> 12:23.010
THE CURRENT TIME IS 23:53

12:27.430 --> 12:29.180
It's almost the time!

12:29.180 --> 12:30.850
Stand by your posts and remain on alert!

12:31.180 --> 12:33.020
Just eight seconds...

12:33.020 --> 12:33.770
Seven seconds...

12:34.100 --> 12:35.190
Six seconds...

12:35.190 --> 12:36.150
Five seconds...

12:36.150 --> 12:36.690
Four...

12:37.230 --> 12:38.110
Three...

12:38.110 --> 12:39.270
Two...

12:39.270 --> 12:39.610
One...

12:40.070 --> 12:40.530
Zero!

12:42.490 --> 12:43.280
The emergency lights!

12:43.530 --> 12:44.700
Turn on the emergency lights!

12:48.330 --> 12:49.740
What the hell are you doing!?

12:53.620 --> 12:55.290
Kaitou Kid!

12:59.040 --> 13:00.590
So you've come, Kid!

13:00.590 --> 13:01.920
I'm not letting you go this time!

13:03.220 --> 13:04.340
After him!

13:12.220 --> 13:13.520
Get him!

13:20.150 --> 13:21.270
Don't be fooled!

13:22.150 --> 13:22.980
Not up there...

13:22.980 --> 13:24.110
He's right in front of you!

13:24.570 --> 13:26.150
Charge!

13:37.620 --> 13:38.420
Damn!

13:44.340 --> 13:46.220
Impossible, isn't that the 50th floor!?

13:46.220 --> 13:47.050
Inspector!

13:47.380 --> 13:48.220
That guy is...

13:49.010 --> 13:50.640
Flying!?

13:51.850 --> 13:52.560
Over there!

13:54.470 --> 13:56.810
Target escaped to Main Avenue and is heading west!

13:56.810 --> 13:57.980
Hurry there immediately!

14:00.190 --> 14:02.230
Team Alpha, surround him from the east!

14:02.230 --> 14:03.570
Team Beta, from the north!

14:03.570 --> 14:04.860
Gamma, hit him the south!

14:05.190 --> 14:06.780
We're going to corner him!

14:25.920 --> 14:26.800
What is this!?

14:26.800 --> 14:27.670
A dummy!?

14:27.670 --> 14:28.550
Remote control!?

14:28.550 --> 14:29.470
What the hell!?

14:36.520 --> 14:37.730
A balloon...

15:00.960 --> 15:03.840
Deploying a dummy while ascending yourself...

15:03.840 --> 15:05.460
Such an antiquated trick.

15:06.250 --> 15:08.170
You're sullying the name of the Phantom Thief!

15:09.130 --> 15:10.760
Who are you!?

15:10.760 --> 15:12.260
I've been waiting for you...

15:12.680 --> 15:13.720
Kaitou Kid!

15:15.890 --> 15:17.560
What does this mean?

15:17.560 --> 15:19.560
Don't tell me he's still in here...

15:20.440 --> 15:22.650
No, he escaped outside...

15:23.770 --> 15:24.610
All that's left is...

15:34.280 --> 15:37.660
Then, are you able to see through <i>this</i> magic?

15:44.170 --> 15:45.630
Stay cool, Kaito.

15:45.630 --> 15:48.210
No matter where you are, always keep a good poker face.

15:51.760 --> 15:54.390
What's wrong—shocked speechless, are you?

15:57.260 --> 15:59.310
Your amateur trick makes me laugh is all!

16:01.020 --> 16:01.980
What!?

16:02.350 --> 16:02.890
Got it!

16:03.730 --> 16:04.600
Bastard...

16:05.060 --> 16:06.650
Prepare yourself!

16:16.070 --> 16:19.580
You wore a mirror around your body
to assimilate into your surroundings.

16:19.580 --> 16:21.330
That serves to give the impression your body has vanished!

16:21.790 --> 16:24.000
Such elementary magic.

16:27.250 --> 16:29.590
Damn, it's too dark to see...

16:30.050 --> 16:31.340
Call the helicopters!

16:31.340 --> 16:32.880
Have them illuminate the roof!

16:33.510 --> 16:35.550
There's no doubt—Kid's hiding on the rooftop!

16:38.810 --> 16:39.970
You...

16:40.770 --> 16:41.390
Can't be...

16:41.810 --> 16:42.770
Master Touichi!?

16:44.480 --> 16:46.400
You're still alive!

16:46.400 --> 16:48.020
I have missed you greatly!

16:48.860 --> 16:50.570
Why did he say my dad's name?

16:50.820 --> 16:53.110
And where have I seen this old guy...

16:54.070 --> 16:57.240
It's me, your faithful servant, Jii, at your service!

16:57.660 --> 16:59.830
It's only been eight years—do you no longer recognize me?

17:00.490 --> 17:01.500
Jii-chan!?

17:01.870 --> 17:05.790
I always thought you were murdered
during that show eight years ago!

17:07.040 --> 17:10.840
For eight years, I grew angrier and angrier...

17:10.840 --> 17:16.010
That's why I finally decided to don the
costume of your alter ego — Kaitou Kid...

17:16.010 --> 17:20.100
To attempt to lure out those who killed you, Master Touichi.

17:20.890 --> 17:21.770
What did you say!?

17:22.060 --> 17:23.600
Dad was killed!?

17:23.600 --> 17:24.810
By who!?

17:24.810 --> 17:25.890
Who murdered him!?

17:27.350 --> 17:28.810
Young Master Kaito...

17:29.230 --> 17:31.400
Why... are you...

17:32.150 --> 17:33.610
I've got one more question.

17:33.610 --> 17:35.400
Please answer me honestly.

17:35.400 --> 17:36.320
Jii-chan...

17:37.410 --> 17:40.030
Was he... a thief?

17:40.780 --> 17:44.200
Was dad... really Kaitou Kid?

17:54.760 --> 17:56.010
Charge!

18:05.930 --> 18:06.310
Yes.

18:07.270 --> 18:09.150
It is as you surmised.

18:13.780 --> 18:15.150
Is that so...

18:15.610 --> 18:20.070
Master Touichi, this is Jii's eternal fault.

18:20.070 --> 18:22.830
I was not supposed to tell Young Master...

18:33.460 --> 18:34.840
I'll distract them.

18:34.840 --> 18:35.800
Jii, get out of here.

18:36.010 --> 18:37.380
But, Young Master...

18:37.380 --> 18:39.380
I'm not a young master anymore!

18:40.930 --> 18:42.510
I'm Kaitou Kid!

18:50.940 --> 18:53.320
We've found you, Kaitou Kid!

18:54.980 --> 18:56.280
Go, after him!

18:58.950 --> 19:01.280
Stay safe, Young Master...

19:08.120 --> 19:09.410
It's over!

19:09.410 --> 19:11.210
You can't escape, Kid!

19:16.710 --> 19:18.050
What are you doing?

19:28.680 --> 19:29.310
What!?

19:36.780 --> 19:38.940
Kid's costume was lifted by a crane!

19:44.450 --> 19:46.490
He just detonated a dummy!

19:47.790 --> 19:49.330
Damn it!

19:49.330 --> 19:51.040
He did it again!

19:58.380 --> 19:59.510
Seeya!

20:11.390 --> 20:12.850
Kid Reappears!

20:12.850 --> 20:14.350
Valued at 400 Million Yen!

20:14.350 --> 20:15.810
Moon's Pupil: Stolen!

20:23.070 --> 20:24.990
400 million yen, huh...

20:26.240 --> 20:26.950
Kaito!

20:27.330 --> 20:28.540
Let me show you something great.

20:30.040 --> 20:31.620
This is your favorite...

20:33.040 --> 20:33.420
FISH

20:33.540 --> 20:35.330
FISH!

20:39.300 --> 20:40.630
It ate the Moon's Pupil!

20:40.960 --> 20:42.470
Salmon, spit it out!

20:42.470 --> 20:43.840
Or, are you a bonito!?

20:43.840 --> 20:45.340
I hate all fish!

20:44.470 --> 20:45.840
What are you doing?

20:45.840 --> 20:47.760
Can't you tell how much this fish is worth!?

20:47.760 --> 20:49.770
Don't faint when you hear this!

20:50.470 --> 20:53.390
Worth: 400,000,000 Yen

21:02.030 --> 21:04.030
What's this?

21:05.740 --> 21:08.330
THIS IS—!?

21:18.000 --> 21:19.920
Now, the show begins!

21:26.590 --> 21:31.600
Episode 1

21:26.590 --> 21:31.600
「Rebirth of the Phantom Thief」
